WEBVTT

00:07.010 --> 00:08.610
You're going out again today?

00:09.180 --> 00:11.510
We're leaving for
Grandma's tomorrow, remember?

00:11.510 --> 00:12.880
Y-Yeah...

00:13.590 --> 00:14.920
Say, Mom...

00:14.920 --> 00:15.590
Hmm?

00:16.860 --> 00:19.540
Dad is still alive, right?

00:19.540 --> 00:21.410
You're bringing this up again?

00:21.410 --> 00:24.130
I told you the other day
that he's still alive, right?

00:24.130 --> 00:25.570
But...

00:25.570 --> 00:27.720
The lawyers handle it,
so I don't really know.

00:28.640 --> 00:31.670
But we are still getting a monthly
child support check.

00:31.670 --> 00:34.020
He sends way too much,
and I'd like to send it back.

00:34.020 --> 00:35.940
What?! Really?

00:35.940 --> 00:37.080
I'm sorry.

00:37.080 --> 00:39.440
It was selfish of me
for not telling you.

00:40.300 --> 00:41.830
It's just that you were so young.

00:41.830 --> 00:45.880
I wanted to be able to say, "I raised her
all by myself!" so I didn't use it.

00:46.760 --> 00:48.780
Of course, it's all yours, Aria.

00:49.120 --> 00:51.550
I thought that maybe
if you started to hate him,

00:51.550 --> 00:55.490
then I'd step in and tell you everything.

00:55.490 --> 00:56.240
You...

00:56.600 --> 00:58.640
...still love him, don't you?

00:59.040 --> 01:01.940
You're always wearing that
childish hairpin he gave you.

01:01.940 --> 01:02.570
Ah...

01:03.430 --> 01:06.160
No, this is...

01:08.520 --> 01:10.590
Do you know, Mom?

01:10.590 --> 01:11.490
Hmm?

01:11.490 --> 01:12.550
Dad...

01:13.240 --> 01:15.080
...is still drawing manga.

01:15.410 --> 01:16.200
I see.

01:17.030 --> 01:17.880
Did you meet him?

01:18.440 --> 01:20.840
No, that's not...

01:21.320 --> 01:23.900
You don't have to tell me, but...

01:25.180 --> 01:27.110
Is he drawing manga that he likes?

01:29.870 --> 01:32.990
If you ever meet him,
tell him this for me, will you?

01:37.540 --> 01:38.460
Okay.

01:42.000 --> 01:46.670
2.5 DIMENSIONAL SEDUCTION

03:08.960 --> 03:13.970
#21 THE STORY OF THE PROTAGONIST

03:14.750 --> 03:16.180
Woah, what is this?!

03:16.760 --> 03:18.580
The buzz is just insane!

03:18.580 --> 03:20.890
So many pictures of Angel Airborne Squad!

03:21.290 --> 03:22.340
- They're so cute.
- Amazing!

03:22.340 --> 03:26.550
- It's so amazing that I'm at a loss for words.
- Sensei, check this out!

03:27.420 --> 03:29.170
Wow, that's wonderful.

03:29.170 --> 03:32.750
That Liliel looks exactly the way
Takamatsu-sensei draws her.

03:32.750 --> 03:34.620
What are you talking about?

03:34.620 --> 03:36.530
Look at this Ariel cosplay!

03:36.530 --> 03:37.960
You're right.

03:37.960 --> 03:40.010
She's really cute too.

03:48.170 --> 03:50.170
Sensei! The manuscript!

03:51.240 --> 03:53.380
Was that cosplay really moving you?

03:54.070 --> 03:56.360
10 years... It's been 10 years...

03:56.360 --> 03:58.900
No, it's gotta be her...

03:59.220 --> 04:01.700
She looks just like her mother
when we first met...

04:02.840 --> 04:04.690
But... Why?

04:07.790 --> 04:08.810
Mita...

04:09.640 --> 04:12.060
Can I still make it if I go
to Comiket right now?

04:12.460 --> 04:14.530
Huh? You really want to go?

04:14.530 --> 04:17.400
Even if you make it to Comiket,
you won't meet the deadline!

04:17.400 --> 04:19.440
If I don't go right now,

04:19.440 --> 04:23.020
I won't be able to call myself a man.

04:23.020 --> 04:28.930
I'm a disgrace of a man
whose work cost him his family!

04:28.930 --> 04:29.870
But...

04:29.870 --> 04:31.180
Family?

04:32.140 --> 04:34.570
Alright, let's start on inking the sketches.

04:34.570 --> 04:36.380
I'm tired of drawing backgrounds anyway.

04:36.380 --> 04:36.840
What?

04:36.840 --> 04:39.630
I don't know what's going on,
but please go.

04:39.630 --> 04:42.540
If it's your drawing,
we can imitate your style perfectly.

04:42.540 --> 04:43.820
Come on, Mita, let's do it!

04:43.820 --> 04:45.380
- You should go now, Sensei.
- Thank you, everyone.

04:45.380 --> 04:47.060
- We'll show you the way.
- Thank you, everyone.

04:47.840 --> 04:49.640
We'll take a 10-minute break!

04:50.120 --> 04:52.280
The crowd didn't decrease at all!

04:52.280 --> 04:54.360
Yes, it's a big difference from yesterday.

04:54.730 --> 04:57.700
Of course.
We practiced so much after all.

05:07.900 --> 05:10.830
There is no way
that girl knows my work.

05:11.400 --> 05:13.360
This is a god's prank,

05:14.000 --> 05:15.920
by a miraculous coincidence.

05:21.210 --> 05:22.420
Where should I go?

05:25.930 --> 05:26.560
Mita?

05:26.560 --> 05:28.200
Sensei, they're at the rooftop venue!

05:28.600 --> 05:30.520
Go to the top of the West Exhibition Hall!

05:31.130 --> 05:32.470
Thank you!

05:34.440 --> 05:35.760
ENTRANCE
For 10 years,

05:35.760 --> 05:36.210
ENTRANCE

05:36.210 --> 05:38.530
I have been drawing shonen manga
in a crooked way.

05:39.130 --> 05:40.770
A person who is kind to others...

05:41.140 --> 05:44.180
I've been sending the message
to be someone I can be proud of.

05:44.580 --> 05:48.810
If my work isn't a lie,
then how could I be one?

05:49.660 --> 05:51.810
So many people here...

05:55.450 --> 05:56.970
Liliel!

06:00.090 --> 06:01.110
Please look here!

06:01.110 --> 06:01.810
Liliel!

06:01.810 --> 06:04.520
She's over there?
But there's so many people...

06:04.520 --> 06:08.500
It feels weird to hear your characters' names
you always draw called out like this.

06:08.500 --> 06:09.120
Mikarin!

06:09.120 --> 06:10.870
But I never drew a Mikarin!

06:10.870 --> 06:12.300
Ariel!

06:25.430 --> 06:27.690
Ah... Aria...

06:28.590 --> 06:30.120
She's all grown up.

06:30.390 --> 06:33.620
I hate you and your manga!

06:35.240 --> 06:38.740
I hurt my daughter because
of my addiction to manga.

06:39.790 --> 06:40.830
But still,

06:41.250 --> 06:43.920
manga was my only way to survive.

06:44.800 --> 06:47.780
I wondered if my absence as a father
has made it rough for her.

06:48.240 --> 06:50.060
She probably hates me...

06:50.560 --> 06:52.450
And she probably hates manga too.

06:53.640 --> 06:56.460
Even though I hurt
the person I love the most,

06:56.870 --> 06:59.030
I still continued to draw manga...

06:59.710 --> 07:01.510
I'm the worst sinner of all.

07:02.080 --> 07:04.900
Ariel is particularly vivid and lively.

07:05.480 --> 07:07.240
Is she based on someone?

07:07.240 --> 07:08.780
N-No...

07:09.240 --> 07:11.780
It wasn't trying to redeem myself.

07:12.430 --> 07:16.500
I was the worst kind of person...
Fixated on drawing an ideal human.

07:17.480 --> 07:19.300
That's who I wanted others to be...

07:20.790 --> 07:22.510
And who I wanted myself to be.

07:23.170 --> 07:23.770
JULY'S FAN LETTER

07:23.770 --> 07:25.560
JULY'S FAN LETTER
I thought it didn't matter

07:25.560 --> 07:28.180
SEPTEMBER'S FAN LETTER
if my feelings didn't reach anyone.

07:29.430 --> 07:31.360
I thought...

07:32.290 --> 07:34.890
I thought it was okay
if it didn't reach anyone...

07:39.050 --> 07:39.860
No.

07:40.690 --> 07:44.190
There's no way that Aria would know
that side story is my work.

07:44.190 --> 07:45.590
It was merely a coincidence.

07:46.530 --> 07:48.870
To be honest, I wanted to ask her
how she truly feels.

07:49.300 --> 07:53.790
But what if I got carried away
and hurt her by talking to her?

07:53.790 --> 07:57.370
Her mother raised her,
so she must be a good girl.

07:57.370 --> 07:59.570
Don't think for a moment
that this redeems you.

08:00.220 --> 08:03.250
Because my sins will never be erased.

08:03.790 --> 08:05.570
We'll take a 10-minute break!

08:07.990 --> 08:09.810
Ink marks and calluses?

08:10.240 --> 08:11.180
Is he a mangaka?

08:12.130 --> 08:13.300
Nah, it can't be...

08:15.840 --> 08:17.050
Senior!

08:17.050 --> 08:18.980
Is everyone in good shape?

08:18.980 --> 08:20.360
Yes, we're fine.

08:20.360 --> 08:21.440
Want to drink something?

08:24.780 --> 08:25.750
Dad...

08:26.240 --> 08:27.200
What?

08:27.200 --> 08:29.570
Kisaki-sensei is here?!

08:29.570 --> 08:31.200
So he's really...

08:31.600 --> 08:32.450
Aria!

08:34.040 --> 08:34.830
Yeah!

08:35.720 --> 08:37.790
Where're you going?
He went that way.

08:38.050 --> 08:40.040
Senior, please buy us some time!

08:40.660 --> 08:41.480
Actually...

08:43.140 --> 08:44.730
You can do that?!

08:45.310 --> 08:47.900
We also brought Melia's costume from V-War!

08:47.900 --> 08:50.430
It's of top-notch quality!

08:50.760 --> 08:53.240
For the sake of reaching out to her father!

08:53.860 --> 08:54.760
I got it!

08:58.360 --> 08:59.230
Higarashi-sensei!

08:59.230 --> 08:59.980
SHOCKED!!
Yes!

08:59.980 --> 09:01.500
SHAKING SHAKING
The deadline is tomorrow, right?

09:01.500 --> 09:02.770
SHAKING SHAKING
I already know that... Wait?

09:02.770 --> 09:03.690
I already know that... Wait?

09:03.690 --> 09:05.520
The editor couldn't possibly be here.

09:09.730 --> 09:10.930
You're...

09:12.960 --> 09:13.990
You're...

09:14.410 --> 09:17.240
E-Errmm... I...

09:17.240 --> 09:18.990
I'm a Liliel otaku!

09:18.990 --> 09:20.050
I knew it!

09:20.050 --> 09:22.790
That's one of the 10 limited edition Liliel caps!

09:23.340 --> 09:25.520
How did you know who I was?

09:25.520 --> 09:29.630
Kind of... Umm, I guessed
from your appearance.

09:32.810 --> 09:34.600
U-Umm...

09:35.020 --> 09:36.680
Can I get your autograph?!

09:37.050 --> 09:38.740
Ah, sure thing.

09:38.740 --> 09:39.880
Please do!

09:42.070 --> 09:42.980
Actually...

09:43.580 --> 09:45.730
This is highly valuable Liliel merch.

09:46.170 --> 09:50.850
You should get it from Takamatsu-sensei,
not from a fake like me.

09:51.320 --> 09:53.820
If you don't mind,
I'll ask him for you.

09:54.460 --> 09:56.530
I want you to sign it.

09:57.120 --> 09:59.080
Please don't call yourself a fake.

09:59.520 --> 10:01.870
I've been reading the side story

10:02.380 --> 10:03.370
for the last 10 years.

10:04.040 --> 10:06.690
I-I see. Alright.

10:07.050 --> 10:07.840
Then...

10:09.800 --> 10:11.510
Thank you very much!

10:11.510 --> 10:13.150
Oh, no, really...

10:13.510 --> 10:15.130
It's my pleasure.

10:15.510 --> 10:18.120
I should take my leave now.

10:18.120 --> 10:19.220
I have a deadline to meet.

10:19.220 --> 10:22.560
Eh?! N-No... E-Ermm...

10:22.560 --> 10:26.060
It may be cheeky of me,
but could you draw Liliel for me?!

10:26.060 --> 10:30.290
S-Sure, that's fine.
But are you sure about that?

10:30.290 --> 10:32.030
Yes, please!

10:32.570 --> 10:36.010
I'm not good at drawing one-shot thing.

10:36.010 --> 10:39.220
- P-Please take your time.
- Hmm, if eyes go here...

10:39.220 --> 10:42.390
Y-You're right.
I have to draw it carefully.

10:42.390 --> 10:45.000
N-No, I didn't mean it like that.

10:46.510 --> 10:46.960
Here.

10:49.170 --> 10:51.330
I'll treasure this as an heirloom.

10:51.330 --> 10:53.220
He drew unexpectedly fast!

10:53.480 --> 10:57.300
Dammit! His look is saying,
'If this is all, I'll be on my way'!

10:57.680 --> 10:59.070
Where's Liliel?!

10:59.070 --> 11:00.260
Then, I'll be on my way.

11:00.930 --> 11:02.220
If this happens...!

11:02.920 --> 11:04.850
I love your Valkyrie War!

11:05.690 --> 11:08.770
Don't tell me the whole world found out
that manga was my work?!

11:08.770 --> 11:09.430
AS I EXPECTED...

11:09.430 --> 11:11.560
AS I EXPECTED...
I was wondering if that might be true.

11:11.560 --> 11:14.110
AS I EXPECTED...
You're very good at setting me up...

11:15.110 --> 11:17.300
But thank you.

11:17.620 --> 11:20.330
I didn't expect there was a kid
who knew of that manga.

11:20.330 --> 11:25.870
Ever since reading the first chapter in Jump,
I looked forward to it every week!

11:25.870 --> 11:30.840
The special move where Melia spreads
her magic wings is really cool!

11:30.840 --> 11:33.320
I really liked the girl with wings!

11:33.320 --> 11:35.860
I hadn't read Ash War Chronicle at the time.

11:35.860 --> 11:39.390
But that's what made me fall in love
with Liliel afterward!

11:39.960 --> 11:42.220
I-I see...

11:43.760 --> 11:44.180
Huh?

11:45.710 --> 11:47.930
Was bringing up
the Ash War Chronicle a mistake?!

11:47.930 --> 11:50.590
I'm sorry, I didn't mean it in a weird way!

11:50.590 --> 11:52.860
No... I'm sorry...

11:53.240 --> 11:57.590
It's just... That was my dark past...

11:57.590 --> 12:01.830
Just hearing the name
or a character from it...

12:02.840 --> 12:04.900
...triggers so many painful memories.

12:05.450 --> 12:08.010
It makes my heart ache...

12:09.400 --> 12:13.320
I know better than anyone
that it was a bad manga.

12:13.320 --> 12:16.130
But it was all I could draw.

12:17.400 --> 12:19.690
If you're a fan of that manga...

12:20.130 --> 12:22.260
Please don't tell that to anyone...

12:24.110 --> 12:25.600
I'm really sorry...

12:26.050 --> 12:28.480
...for saying something like this.

12:29.460 --> 12:31.630
But I just...

12:32.030 --> 12:33.400
...want to forget all about it.

12:36.440 --> 12:37.360
What is he...

12:37.870 --> 12:39.070
...talking about?!

12:39.560 --> 12:43.280
It's not that I can't imagine
how he feels.

12:43.660 --> 12:44.230
THANK YOU VERY MUCH FOR
YOUR KIND LETTER, OKUMURA.

12:44.230 --> 12:44.680
BUT DON'T TELL YOUR FRIENDS
That won't do!

12:44.680 --> 12:45.150
THAT YOU LIKE MY MANGA.
That won't do!

12:45.150 --> 12:45.540
THEY'LL BULLY YOU.
That won't do!

12:46.450 --> 12:49.530
Aria is on her way dressed as Melia.

12:49.910 --> 12:53.200
If I don't do something,
this'll be the worst possible reunion.

12:55.450 --> 12:56.920
Should I stop Aria?

12:56.920 --> 12:58.510
No, that's not it!

12:59.720 --> 13:02.480
Lilysa, Aria...
I'm sorry.

13:02.890 --> 13:05.260
I may have to do more than just buy time.

13:05.920 --> 13:07.180
From here on out,

13:07.720 --> 13:09.100
it's all about me!

13:09.920 --> 13:10.920
Please stop it.

13:10.920 --> 13:11.480
Eh?

13:12.350 --> 13:13.990
Please don't say "that manga."

13:14.380 --> 13:15.240
The author,

13:15.660 --> 13:17.820
has no right to discredit his work!

13:18.240 --> 13:20.130
Are children the property of their parents?

13:20.130 --> 13:22.570
Neither does an author's work
belong to the author.

13:23.190 --> 13:25.050
It doesn't belong to us readers either.

13:25.590 --> 13:27.080
It's an independent 2D thing.

13:27.920 --> 13:32.680
What anyone thinks of the work
should not be dictated by anyone!

13:33.080 --> 13:36.840
No matter what you say,
I'll always love it!

13:37.730 --> 13:39.350
And I'll never forget it...

13:40.100 --> 13:41.300
...even if you do!

13:41.300 --> 13:42.300
TO YO KISAKI-SENSEI
FROM: OKUMURA

13:44.220 --> 13:46.640
Are you Okumura?

13:47.000 --> 13:48.650
What's so wrong about that manga?!

13:48.650 --> 13:52.140
Do you think there's ever been
a manga that no one hated?!

13:52.140 --> 13:54.040
What you call "a fake"?!

13:54.040 --> 13:56.360
What's wrong with drawing derivative works?!

13:56.360 --> 13:57.400
What did you think

13:57.840 --> 14:00.380
when you saw Liliel's cosplay?!

14:00.380 --> 14:02.030
Did you think she's a fake?!

14:02.390 --> 14:04.110
No, that's...

14:04.110 --> 14:06.900
Can't you get my message
unless I say it clearly?!

14:06.900 --> 14:09.290
I don't care what you,
the author, might think!

14:09.290 --> 14:12.000
Listen! I'll tell you the truth
right here and now!

14:12.850 --> 14:13.960
When I reflect back,

14:14.570 --> 14:17.940
I've only seen my life as the truth.

14:20.380 --> 14:25.110
The manga that you drew makes me happy!

14:25.110 --> 14:28.220
You have no right to change that fact!

14:28.220 --> 14:30.860
No author has the right to change that!

14:36.520 --> 14:37.530
10 years...

14:38.390 --> 14:41.150
I haven't had a single
good memory in 10 years...

14:41.800 --> 14:43.640
We're canceling it, Kisaki-sensei.

14:44.050 --> 14:46.060
Please wrap the story up in five chapters.

14:46.060 --> 14:49.930
The first and second volumes
will be published consecutively...

14:50.410 --> 14:52.190
To be honest, I was relieved.

14:52.870 --> 14:55.370
I realized I couldn't draw anymore.

14:55.910 --> 14:58.710
Someday, I'll have a series with
this girl as the main character!

14:59.140 --> 15:00.940
And you'll be my first reader!

15:00.940 --> 15:02.040
Okay, okay.

15:02.040 --> 15:03.710
- This girl looks like me, doesn't she?
- I was having so much fun drawing it...

15:03.710 --> 15:05.210
- So you knew it!
- I was having so much fun drawing it...

15:05.210 --> 15:08.120
I loved it with all my heart...

15:12.520 --> 15:14.380
I always wished...

15:14.890 --> 15:16.560
...that I hadn't drawn it.

15:17.600 --> 15:22.300
There is no such thing as a child
that should've never been born.

15:23.500 --> 15:25.260
I never imagined it...

15:25.900 --> 15:26.830
Melia...

15:27.420 --> 15:31.670
You were making someone happy
without my knowledge.

15:32.980 --> 15:35.540
No... I chose to look the other way.

15:36.390 --> 15:39.370
Even though there was someone
who loved my manga...

15:39.750 --> 15:42.580
I couldn't truly believe it...

15:42.880 --> 15:43.540
JUMP NEWCOMER MANGA AWARD

15:43.540 --> 15:44.880
RUNNER-UP!
In Weekly Shonen Jump...

15:44.880 --> 15:45.440
In Weekly Shonen Jump...

15:45.440 --> 15:47.690
I wanted to impress one
million people who read it.

15:47.690 --> 15:48.760
VALKYRIE WAR

15:48.760 --> 15:52.100
VALKYRIE WAR
But I couldn't even make one person happy!

15:53.350 --> 15:57.020
I didn't realize how precious making
even one person happy could be.

15:58.260 --> 15:59.880
Forgive me, Aria...

16:00.490 --> 16:02.490
For not realizing...

16:02.490 --> 16:07.280
That it was more important to make you
happy than to impress a million people.

16:08.500 --> 16:10.190
Please forgive me, Melia...

16:11.150 --> 16:14.120
You were better and more
praiseworthy than I was...

16:14.120 --> 16:15.310
VALKYRIE WAR

16:15.310 --> 16:17.620
VALKYRIE WAR
I'm sorry for hating you so much...

16:18.690 --> 16:22.210
You were my precious daughter...

16:23.330 --> 16:24.520
Please forgive me...

16:24.900 --> 16:25.720
Please...

16:26.320 --> 16:27.250
Please...

16:29.460 --> 16:30.300
Dad.

16:43.260 --> 16:46.040
Me... Melia...

16:46.650 --> 16:47.230
A...

16:47.930 --> 16:48.460
A...

16:49.240 --> 16:50.160
Ari...

16:50.160 --> 16:51.430
Aria...

16:51.910 --> 16:53.120
Why...

16:53.890 --> 16:55.080
Why?

16:56.960 --> 17:00.790
Can't you tell? About my feelings...

17:01.440 --> 17:03.600
I'm sorry... I'm really sorry...

17:07.340 --> 17:10.720
Dad, I'm sorry too.

17:11.480 --> 17:14.650
Okumura already said
most of what I wanted to say.

17:16.960 --> 17:18.670
Let's make up.

17:20.730 --> 17:23.420
10 years is already enough time.

17:27.710 --> 17:30.000
Am I dirty to you?

17:32.630 --> 17:34.100
Don't worry.

17:34.100 --> 17:36.990
I finished my rebellious phase
with Mom last year.

17:37.400 --> 17:39.830
I'm sorry about that.

17:40.240 --> 17:42.560
Please don't apologize anymore.

17:43.690 --> 17:45.790
Parents can be so cold and annoying.

17:46.760 --> 17:48.710
They can fight and disappear.

17:50.080 --> 17:52.050
There are days when I hate them.

17:53.250 --> 17:56.390
But do you think any child
wants to hate their parents?

17:57.410 --> 18:00.360
I'm your daughter.

18:00.360 --> 18:02.450
So I think I know how Melia feels.

18:03.230 --> 18:05.210
That's why we're here together.

18:08.060 --> 18:10.060
I'm going to say this once,

18:10.060 --> 18:12.370
both for me and for Melia.

18:18.070 --> 18:21.410
Thank you for bringing me
into this world.

18:26.620 --> 18:27.640
I'm the one...

18:29.170 --> 18:30.710
Who should be...

18:31.180 --> 18:32.890
...thanking you.

18:34.120 --> 18:35.030
Aria.

18:35.830 --> 18:36.680
Melia.

18:38.040 --> 18:39.720
Thank you...

18:40.390 --> 18:41.810
...for coming into this world.

18:42.840 --> 18:43.530
Yes.

18:43.930 --> 18:46.100
Since you only existed in manga,

18:46.480 --> 18:48.670
I'd never get to meet you.

18:49.910 --> 18:51.490
10 years...

18:52.000 --> 18:53.950
Oh... Today...

18:54.520 --> 18:55.800
...is a good day.

18:58.160 --> 19:03.020
In other words! Let me tell you how much
the "Side Story" affected Liliel's character!

19:03.480 --> 19:06.870
Since Liliel only played a supporting role
in the Ash War Chronicle,

19:06.870 --> 19:08.710
she became the main character

19:08.710 --> 19:10.990
- and had to overcome conflicts and difficulties!
- You don't want to talk more with your dad?

19:10.990 --> 19:11.400
- And the second volume
- You don't want to talk more with your dad?

19:11.400 --> 19:12.310
- And the second volume
- Well...

19:12.310 --> 19:14.170
- was a legendary turning point for us fans!
- I'm not sure what I would say.

19:14.170 --> 19:15.460
- was a legendary turning point for us fans!
- I'll just give this time to Lilysa.

19:15.460 --> 19:17.010
- I see.
- She's talking to him

19:17.010 --> 19:18.540
- And there...
- more than his own daughter is.

19:18.540 --> 19:22.350
He may be a father to Aria.
But to me and Lilysa, he's a god.

19:22.350 --> 19:24.370
TO LILYSA - TO MIKARI
Alright. Will this be good?

19:24.370 --> 19:25.060
TO NOA - TO OKUMURA

19:25.060 --> 19:26.890
TO LILYSA - TO OKUMURA
Thank you so much!

19:26.890 --> 19:29.870
TO LILYSA - TO OKUMURA
I knew bringing signboards would pay off!

19:29.870 --> 19:30.770
TO LILYSA - TO OKUMURA
Indeed!

19:31.320 --> 19:33.880
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

19:34.970 --> 19:38.250
Thank you for cosplaying
Liliel's side story characters.

19:39.640 --> 19:43.660
I'm so happy to have fans like you guys.

19:44.470 --> 19:47.120
Also, it's hard for me to say...

19:47.410 --> 19:51.790
Actually, I'm planning to finish
the serialization of Liliel's side story.

19:51.790 --> 19:54.800
You want to end it?!
Even though there's already an anime of it?!

19:54.800 --> 19:57.000
Could it be your work isn't selling well?

19:57.000 --> 19:59.590
Well, it's just numbers aren't growing.

20:00.000 --> 20:04.230
The editors told me that since
it's a long-term serial and not in the red,

20:04.530 --> 20:07.690
I can end it whenever I want.

20:07.690 --> 20:10.530
So you wanted to end it
on your own terms?

20:10.530 --> 20:13.780
But is it okay for you
to tell us about that?

20:14.160 --> 20:17.240
Well, that's not the plan anymore.

20:17.790 --> 20:19.840
When all you hear are only numbers,

20:19.840 --> 20:23.740
it can be disheartening to be told
that your work isn't growing.

20:24.060 --> 20:24.860
But today,

20:24.860 --> 20:28.620
I can clearly see the faces of the readers
who are buying and reading the manga.

20:29.080 --> 20:31.330
So I gotta keep drawing for you guys.

20:31.650 --> 20:32.680
Then...

20:32.680 --> 20:36.270
If the sales go up,
I'm sure the editors won't complain.

20:36.270 --> 20:39.260
Still, I don't know
what to do moving forward.

20:39.930 --> 20:42.030
You still don't want to read it?

20:42.030 --> 20:44.160
It's Takamatsu-sensei's manga after all.

20:44.160 --> 20:46.480
It's not for a fake like me.

20:49.160 --> 20:51.950
Liliel's side story is my manga.

20:52.550 --> 20:55.110
It's only over when I stop drawing it.

20:56.560 --> 20:59.620
They did say I could stop it
whenever I wanted to.

20:59.620 --> 21:02.260
So I'll strive to keep drawing
until they fire me.

21:02.260 --> 21:03.200
I promise.

21:04.590 --> 21:07.160
I owe you guys for making me feel this way.

21:09.340 --> 21:11.770
The Angel Airborne Squad cosplayers.

21:12.190 --> 21:13.210
And...

21:13.820 --> 21:17.470
You saved me once again, Okumura.

21:17.470 --> 21:18.300
Again?

21:18.300 --> 21:20.550
TO YO KISAKI-SENSEI
FROM: OKUMURA

21:21.510 --> 21:23.100
You're exaggerating.

21:23.740 --> 21:26.680
I've just always been an otaku.

21:29.520 --> 21:31.070
Well, I should get going.

21:31.910 --> 21:33.880
I have a deadline tonight.

21:34.170 --> 21:37.320
And if I don't finish up the manuscript,
I could get fired this week.

21:37.320 --> 21:38.640
T-That's bad!

21:38.640 --> 21:40.820
You have to get back now!

21:41.690 --> 21:43.600
Then, Aria...

21:43.600 --> 21:44.370
Yes.

21:45.790 --> 21:47.160
That hairpin...

21:47.880 --> 21:49.700
So you're still wearing it.

21:49.700 --> 21:50.870
You still remember?

21:51.250 --> 21:52.920
Of course.

21:53.250 --> 21:54.830
After all...

21:55.190 --> 21:57.730
...your mom bought it for you.

21:57.730 --> 22:00.230
Now I look like Melia!

22:00.230 --> 22:02.150
I found it at the department store.

22:02.150 --> 22:04.750
And I thought both you and dad
would love it.

22:05.720 --> 22:08.000
Dad won't come out of his room.

22:08.000 --> 22:11.330
Ah... It's because we're having
a bit of a fight right now.

22:11.330 --> 22:13.330
I forgot it while I was shopping.

22:13.330 --> 22:14.900
I feel like an idiot.

22:17.980 --> 22:19.850
Dad wants to talk to you, mom.

22:19.850 --> 22:20.790
Sorry...

22:20.790 --> 22:22.630
No, I'm sorry too...

22:23.670 --> 22:26.370
I don't want to lose it...

22:29.840 --> 22:31.360
So I never take it off.

22:34.870 --> 22:38.420
Because it's the hairpin that made
my mom and dad make up.

22:40.300 --> 22:42.130
I see.

22:42.610 --> 22:43.750
Hey, dad.

22:44.920 --> 22:46.510
Mom gave me a message.

22:47.030 --> 22:47.990
From mom?

22:49.300 --> 22:50.560
What are you drawing?

22:53.390 --> 22:55.300
T-That's...

22:55.300 --> 22:57.040
Hey, this is pretty good!

22:57.040 --> 22:58.560
Eh? Really?

22:58.560 --> 23:00.030
Has no one told you that before?

23:00.570 --> 23:03.190
I've never shown it to anyone.

23:04.520 --> 23:06.700
Guess that makes me your first reader.

23:07.640 --> 23:09.910
That's kind of special, isn't it?

23:19.610 --> 23:21.710
What did mom say?

23:21.710 --> 23:24.670
Well, I didn't really understand it, but...

23:25.560 --> 23:29.330
She said,
"Show your next manga to me first."

23:34.150 --> 23:34.970
Yeah.

23:39.040 --> 23:42.820
I was always happy,
and I am still happy.

23:42.820 --> 23:46.580
That's because I loved your dad
with all my heart.

23:46.580 --> 23:49.390
That is a fact that will never change.

23:52.070 --> 23:53.630
I promise.

23:55.040 --> 24:00.900
IN THIS WONDERFUL WORLD
